        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s4_1",
            "speaker": "MELANIE",
            "text": "I've seen a list of plays that are being performed this week, and I'd like to know which are suitable for my children, and which ones my husband and I might go to.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_2",
            "speaker": "ROB",
            "text": "How old are your children?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_3",
            "speaker": "MELANIE",
            "text": "Five and seven. What about 'The Mystery of Muldoon'?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_4",
            "speaker": "ROB",
            "text": "That's aimed at five to ten-year-olds.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_5",
            "speaker": "MELANIE",
            "text": "So if I take my children, I can expect them to enjoy it more than I do?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_6",
            "speaker": "ROB",
            "text": "I think so. If you'd like something for yourself and your husband and leave your children with a babysitter, you might like to see 'Fire and Flood' - it's about events that really happened in Stretton two hundred years ago, and children might find it rather frightening.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_7",
            "speaker": "MELANIE",
            "text": "Oh, thanks for the warning. And finally, what about 'Silly Sailor'?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_8",
            "speaker": "ROB",
            "text": "That's a comedy, and it's for young and old. In fact, it won an award in the Stretton Drama Festival a couple of months ago.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_9",
            "speaker": "MELANIE",
            "text": "OK. Well, goodbye, and thanks for all the information. I'm looking forward to the festival!",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s4_10",
            "speaker": "ROB",
            "text": "Goodbye.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
